# Persistence

Persistence implements domain contracts. It does not import application services, GraphQL, or REST.

- `*.repository.ts` exports `class <Name>Repository extends MongooseSeedwork.MongoRepositoryBase implements <Name>Repository`
- The domain package has the matching `*.repository.ts` interface
- `*.domain-adapter.ts` exports `<Name>DomainAdapter extends MongooseSeedwork.MongooseDomainAdapter` and `<Name>Converter extends MongooseSeedwork.MongoTypeConverter`
- `*.uow.ts` exports `const get<Name>UnitOfWork` and wires `MongoUnitOfWork`, `InProcEventBusInstance`, and `NodeEventBusInstance`
- Readonly data sources live under `datasources/readonly/` and extend `MongoDataSourceImpl`
- Do not import `<camel>Seed`. Insert that document into the database and read it through the model
- Filenames use the same kebab-case stem as the domain type